  "published": "2026-10-28T09:57:36.807Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Replaces 1.11.13.1, which was packed from stale local build output and should not be used: its static web asset manifest still described the 1.11.13 html-to-image-interop.js (old integrity and length under the same fingerprinted URL), so apps enforcing import-map integrity could not load the module and browsers that had cached 1.11.13 kept running the old one, and its net6.0-net9.0 assemblies were built from 1.11.13 without the options below. This release is built by CI from a clean checkout; the code is unchanged from 1.11.13.1. Changes since 1.11.13: captures repeat until two consecutive results are identical (StabilizeAttempts, default 3), because WebKit rasterizes the capture before large embedded images have decoded and leaves them blank; every capture attempt is bounded by CaptureTimeoutMs (default 30000), because upstream's createImage never settles when Safari rejects HTMLImageElement.decode() under memory pressure.",
